{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "870117c9-eba0-5790-bd48-12d86e67fc1c", "source_ordinal": 2494, "reading_ordinal": 1559, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "痛苦问题", "published_at": "2022-12-09T10:28:02+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/379797015/answer/2793932552"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "现实的来说，感觉到痛苦有两个最直接有效的短期办法。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "第一个，是收拾内务。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "也就是把抽屉、箱子、邮箱、硬盘……打开摊开，重新组织、修复、整理。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "去芜存菁，修缮如新，分门别类，各归其位。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这实际上是一种“整军经武”的行为，这个功夫做得越好，你的士气自然会恢复不少。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "从另一个角度来说，这些私人物品实际上是你自己身体的一部分，还是你不需要开刀就可以治疗的一部分。", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "看似那是钢笔、电脑，实际上那都是你的器官。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "既然是伤病了，当然从最好治疗的器官开始。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这本身有实质的治疗作用，绝非仅仅只是有视觉上的愉悦感而已。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "第二，是去做一件不折不扣的善事。", "char_start": 253, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "受伤获病，在很多人看来是理所当然的应该坐等ta人履行同情义务的良机。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 304}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "乃至于往往“携难趋恶”。", "char_start": 305, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "“我已经落难了，你们谁再来要求我当什么好人，要挑我什么礼，你们还是人吗。”", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 355}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "“未经他人苦，莫劝他人善。”", "char_start": 356, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "很多人就趁着落难，开始享受起这个“落难者可以恶一点”的福利来了，开始等着别人来履行社会义务。", "char_start": 371, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "殊不知，这样的心态只会导致你经由强烈的期望走向失望，进而绝望。", "char_start": 418, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "ta人滥施、而你所滥收的各种似是而非的帮助，因为往往不能解决问题，往往不断的让你失望。", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而以受难者自居，趁机松弛自我道德要求的做法、更要把你自己推进地狱。", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 527}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你需要的其实不是这类无意识的“趁你病有难，低价进点好人卡”的“正义投机”，更不是“非礼免罪卡”，而是真正的善缘。", "char_start": 529, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "heading", "index": 20, "text": "而“身在危难中，仍不忘与人为善”，是最好的善缘打火石。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "而你仍然有能力、有心情在这个条件下帮助别人，是你自己对你自己信心的最好检验。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 652}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你要先有这个信心，才有可能行以为常。", "char_start": 653, "char_end": 671}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "没有什么比“危难之中，节操如铁”更有效的建立个人品牌的方式了。", "char_start": 672, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这个品牌不倒，转机往往不远。", "char_start": 704, "char_end": 718}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "就算不谈转机。单单是这个行为带来的自信本身，都足以扭转你自己身上的低气压。", "char_start": 719, "char_end": 756}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "为人处世，义理为先，死而后已，何谓难乎？", "char_start": 757, "char_end": 777}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你站稳这个立场，就会最大限度的触发正面的因素来帮你——这种被激发的帮助，就不会是得意洋洋准备廉价在你身上赚点好人卡等着将来市恩的虚应故事，而是看出你绝非池中之物，实属奇货可居，想要捷足先登的果断决绝。", "char_start": 778, "char_end": 878}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这不见得立竿见影解决你的问题，但是已经是你最好的机会。", "char_start": 879, "char_end": 906}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你可以试试。", "char_start": 907, "char_end": 913}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "（未完，待续）", "char_start": 914, "char_end": 921}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 31, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0240"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：感到生活痛苦该怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "围绕“痛苦问题”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“现实的来说，感觉到痛苦有两个最直接有效的短期办法。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "现实的来说，感觉到痛苦有两个最直接有效的短期办法。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "77151d4f-fc9c-57d2-9e91-4a3dd3a30fec", "source_ordinal": 2493, "reading_ordinal": 1560, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "blender", "published_at": "2022-12-10T20:04:46+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/508310078/answer/2796012866"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "举个例子——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "blender允许存在不为任何面所有的独立边。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "它允许存在poly curve。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "将svg线条导入blender会将所有点自动识别为smooth点。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "它的constraint和geometry node非常强大，但是却恰恰是因为强大，反而与其他体系很难兼容。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "那意味着导出之后这些属性都会有些问题。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "很多这类设定会导致它在导入其他软件或者引擎时出现隐患。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这种隐患很可能不立刻在下一个流程里体现出来，而是在最后导入引擎后出现奇怪的法线问题、碰撞检测问题、缩放问题。要定位这些问题常常非常困难——甚至是不可能的。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "blender对fbx格式的支持自己都分legacy版本和新版本，是用插件实现的。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 305}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这些成本对这些工艺已经成熟的企业是很不想去花时间适应的。", "char_start": 306, "char_end": 334}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "反过来，那些正版max、maya、zbrush的授权费用，比起那些资深游戏美术的薪资来说根本不值一提，谈不上多大的成本节省，更不必说这笔钱花出去，其实主要是买了一个热情而随叫随到的客服。", "char_start": 335, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "企业运行有这个客服非常重要。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "blender的前途是很远大的，只是现在还没到时候。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 470}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "说它前途远大，其实主要是因为omniverse可能成为未来的新中间件标准。", "char_start": 471, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所有的DCC软件都会渐渐趋向于去支持omniverse工作流，而ominiverse主推的USD格式有希望替代FBX格式。而blender看上去赶上了这个新浪潮。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "换言之，USD可能抹平blender在这方面的技术欠债。", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "一旦这个被抹平了，blender很有希望成为一个和max和maya分庭抗礼的对手。", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 661}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "尤其是，现在这个blender app的方向很有意思，可能成为blender的新优势。", "char_start": 662, "char_end": 705}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "并且，也不能忽略blender core直接孵化出新的游戏引擎的可能性。", "char_start": 706, "char_end": 742}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "总之，blender虽然现在还不太能直接顶替max，但是作为个人工作流还是很不错的。", "char_start": 743, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "毕竟它一家就足以免掉你买那么一大堆软件的费用。", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 809}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "尤其是，它不依赖x86架构，你可以在mac甚至linux上使用它——这个可是真正重要的特性。", "char_start": 810, "char_end": 856}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这意味着有一天max、maya可能会给操作系统陪葬，但blender一定不会。", "char_start": 857, "char_end": 896}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0240"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：游戏建模为什么不能是 blender + Zbrush 的工作流呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“blender”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“举个例子——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "举个例子——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6599f61e-24ee-525c-864f-9dea398c3b81", "source_ordinal": 2492, "reading_ordinal": 1561, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "亦真亦假", "published_at": "2022-12-11T16:36:23+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/571565505/answer/2796995516"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "问一个更根本的问题——国际条约到底是一种什么性质的东西？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "或者更确切的来说，人与人之间签订的合同、协议，到底是一种什么东西？", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 62}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你们必须清醒的认识到这样一个基本事实，并且老老实实的刻在脑子里——", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "heading", "index": 4, "text": "由人与人协商并签订、并由人力来实施违约惩罚的协议，追根到底是有限责任的。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你只能在“对方当前从中获得的收益大于这有限的违约责任”的前提下对这个协议的效力报以强度恰当的期望。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这既不是赌气般的认定“所有的约定都是骗人的”，也不是轻率的以为“人而无信，必遭天谴”。", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 227}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "国家这种主体在契约关系中的特性尤其如此。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "对于一个人类，明确的违背自愿契约是有一定的长期代价的——会抬高和所有知情人的交易门槛，这都是真金白银。（但是要注意，对方并不会把这个成本看做无限大。）", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "但是对于一个国家，“失信”的成本却可以用换一个内阁、换一个执政党、换一个国王来一次性“冲销”。", "char_start": 325, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "对于某些存在换届机制的多党制“民主”国家而言，这甚至可以理解为每隔一到两个换届期就有一张过期作废的“毁约卡”。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这意味着国家之间的条约在客观上仅仅只是一种“谅解备忘录”。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "它是否会被执行，根本就不看这个条约本身的期限约定，而仅仅取决于双方是否都在其中获得了大于成本的收益。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 509}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "尽管忠实履约所换得的信誉本身也是一种收益，但这仍然只是一种有限的、具体的收益，放进整个收益公式里并不能保证所得净值为正。", "char_start": 510, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但这并不全是坏消息。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 581}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为这意味着国际条约并无所谓“真假”。", "char_start": 582, "char_end": 601}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "产生的利益不够，“真的”也可以变成假的。", "char_start": 602, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "但产生的利益足够，“假的”也可以变成真的。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 644}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "换句话来说，一个健康的契约观，并不会将签订的契约的真实性看得过于执着。", "char_start": 646, "char_end": 681}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "绝不会因为签订了条文就认为这个约定是“真的””了。", "char_start": 682, "char_end": 707}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "它“真”不“真”，更多的取决于你后来怎么做，而不取决于你签定的条款。", "char_start": 708, "char_end": 742}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "并不会因为你们签订了条款约定“对方做A交换你做B”，就一定意味着你做了B，对方就真的一定会做A。", "char_start": 743, "char_end": 791}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "对方做不做A，其实并不取决于——至少不全然取决于——你有没有做B。", "char_start": 792, "char_end": 825}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而是取决于对你保持信用于ta有多大的价值。", "char_start": 826, "char_end": 847}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "如果对方认为对你保持信用的价值很低，那么无论你有没有履约，对方恐怕都不会履约。", "char_start": 848, "char_end": 887}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "如果对方认为对你保持信用——准确的说，是获得你的青睐和支持——价值巨大，那么甚至无论你有没有履约，对方都会履约——因此才有所谓“舔狗对女神的委曲求全”的现象。", "char_start": 888, "char_end": 967}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "真正驱动对方“履行条约”的要害，其实并不是条约，而是你，是你的好意对对方有多大的意义。", "char_start": 968, "char_end": 1011}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你会履行你的那部分约定这一事实，仅仅是获得你的好意的价值的一部分，而非全部。", "char_start": 1012, "char_end": 1050}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "最常见的错误正在于此——很多人误以为自己履约了，就意味着对方也一定有了履约的全部动力，于是把增强对方履约动力的全部努力，都集中在了履行自己这一半的义务上。", "char_start": 1051, "char_end": 1128}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "事实上你应该把主要的努力放在“获得我的好意对你有哪些重要价值”上，而非“我在努力履约”上。", "char_start": 1129, "char_end": 1174}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "更不必说将全部精力都用在无原则的增加履约满意度上了。", "char_start": 1175, "char_end": 1201}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这种满意度的提升是有限度的——尤其是要从95分提升到98分，所需要的资源远超过从90分提升到95分。", "char_start": 1202, "char_end": 1252}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "因此你经常会遇到这样一个问题——是把这份精力用在将履约满意度从95提升到98上，还是用在提升自我，让对方觉得维持你的好意有长期的利益上。", "char_start": 1253, "char_end": 1321}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "说得直白点——这份精力用在学习新的技能、构建新的资产、开拓新的资源上，要比用在将履约满意度从95提高到98上，更能促使对方积极履约。", "char_start": 1322, "char_end": 1388}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这不是教你“不诚信”——因为诚信问题早在满意度超过80分时就已经解决了。", "char_start": 1389, "char_end": 1425}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "而是在教你认识清楚客观世界对人的契约观的限定。", "char_start": 1426, "char_end": 1449}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "选择95-98，让自己精疲力竭以至于无法自我发展，你实际上在鼓励和诱惑对方背信弃义以获得最大的利益。", "char_start": 1450, "char_end": 1500}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "选择将80以上的部分节省下来，使得自身强大，让对方不能不憧憬获得你的友谊、顾虑失去你的善意的损失，你将获得最大的可持续性。", "char_start": 1501, "char_end": 1562}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "这是客观规律，是自然法，不受任何政治正确或意识形态的判断影响。", "char_start": 1563, "char_end": 1594}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "看明白了这一点，以后就不要再纠结于你签约的对方倒是真情还是假意。", "char_start": 1595, "char_end": 1627}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你自强不息，“假的”也会变成真的——只要对方会算数。", "char_start": 1628, "char_end": 1654}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "你自甘乡愿，“真的“也可以变成“假的”。", "char_start": 1655, "char_end": 1675}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "你放心，以人类的巧舌如簧，自有办法将ta们的逃避解释为“已经充分履行了义务”。", "char_start": 1676, "char_end": 1715}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "所以，你不用看普京说得多么可怜巴巴，做为在位二十多年的领袖，ta绝对清楚“条约本身无所谓真假”的道理。", "char_start": 1717, "char_end": 1768}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "反而是你为这个“真假”心情荡漾，才令人担忧。", "char_start": 1769, "char_end": 1791}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "是真是假，操之在我。", "char_start": 1792, "char_end": 1802}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 46, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0240"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：普京回应默克尔「本该更早对乌采取行动，但当时信了明斯克协议」，如何评价这一协议对俄乌局势的影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045"], "summary": "围绕“亦真亦假”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“问一个更根本的问题——国际条约到底是一种什么性质的东西？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "问一个更根本的问题——国际条约到底是一种什么性质的东西？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5cfe5df3-bf20-5fbc-93a9-dd69b58d74c2", "source_ordinal": 2491, "reading_ordinal": 1562, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "有钱人", "published_at": "2022-12-13T10:18:12+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/292422462/answer/2799230911"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "说实在的，别人有没有钱，跟你没啥本质的关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "在财务方面，所谓有钱，只有一个简单的标准——能自食其力且足以支付ta自己的社会责任。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "所谓能支付自己的社会责任，是指能独力负担自己的债务、赡养自己的父母、能分担应分的抚养子女的成本。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个标准是双向的，也就是双方都要各自达到这个标准。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不要幻想自己达不到这个标准而可以通过婚姻理所当然的借对方的“光”，这是肯定要付出人格代价的。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人是社会关系的总和，而社会责任是社会关系的基础。换句话来说，人也是社会责任的总和。所以，无法承担自己的社会责任的人，自然而然的要沦为“半人”“类人”。盘算着通过“借光”来应付自己的社会责任的人，将来将会失去反对ta人“不尊重”的客观立场。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "尽管人有各种政治正确傍身，似乎可以发起某种对这种“不尊重”的“集体讨伐”，但是坦率地讲，这种“不尊重”背后的支撑是自然法。具体点讲，就是打着这种主意的人，迟早要主动的拿“你选ta们你还得尊重ta们，你选我就不需要尊重我”当成一种“卖点”，来换取一些对凌辱ta人有嗜好的人的偏好。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“不必尊重”就是卖点，还谈什么“不允许不尊重”？", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "总而言之，所谓“有钱”，存在一个客观标准——就是其劳动收入可以支付自己的社会责任而有余的人。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 520}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这不包括任何不对应劳动的收入，不包括“足以支付一切需求的存量财富”，仅仅包括对应劳动的收入。（仔细调查进行明智的投资是劳动的一种，但不付出任何劳动的纯食利则不算。）", "char_start": 521, "char_end": 603}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "一个不劳动的人，无论ta的账户中有多少余额，在这个定义下都不属于有钱人。一个账户中有大量余额，但是却拒绝或无法支付其社会责任的人，在这个定义下也不属于有钱人。一个月劳动所得并不丰厚，但是支付自己的社会责任而有余的人，在这个定义下属于有钱人。", "char_start": 604, "char_end": 724}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "哪怕只多一块钱，你也一定要与有钱人为伍。哪怕只多一块钱，你自己也要做个有钱人。", "char_start": 725, "char_end": 764}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0240"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女孩子真的要嫁给有钱人吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“有钱人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“说实在的，别人有没有钱，跟你没啥本质的关系。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "说实在的，别人有没有钱，跟你没啥本质的关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1b76917b-aeeb-5990-b9bf-8416f4676299", "source_ordinal": 2490, "reading_ordinal": 1563, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "默认处理", "published_at": "2022-12-14T08:59:50+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/412344436/answer/2800534394"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个不存在处理。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "在其他公司来做入职背景调查的时候，如实告知离职原因即可。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在大多数语境下，处理意味着要改变既定流程或者既定原则，来个“特事特办”。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "所以，不改变任何既定流程和既定原则而产生的结果，可以被认为是“无处理”的“本来的结果”。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "于是这就产生了一个基本教训——如果你发现一件事，沿着对方/社会普遍的既定流程和既定原则运转下去就会产生对你不利的结果，那么你就不要干。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "明知故犯的干这种事，就是经典的愚蠢行为。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因为对方不需要做任何特殊的操作、改变任何的原则甚至习惯，就能对你自动的造成惩罚性的伤害，其成本是极低的，甚至可以说，要避免对你造成惩罚，还得临时专门改掉原有的生产线，反而要付出更多成本。", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "往这种机制上撞，是愚蠢的一种经典的表现。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 323}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "无论你打算实现什么目的，不管是正义的还是邪恶的，是公义的还是私义的，甚至是不义的，“不能用愚蠢的方式”都是一个很显然的基本原则。", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 388}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0240"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：辞职的时候，有人在离职原因上写“胃不好、消化不了领导画的饼”，该如何处理？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“默认处理”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个不存在处理。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个不存在处理。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b8da2d88-66cf-5304-a641-14617b838fa6", "source_ordinal": 2489, "reading_ordinal": 1564, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "关键", "published_at": "2022-12-15T19:39:07+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/329365774/answer/2802863542"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "中国政治哲学的核心，其实是经验主义。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "甚至经验主义的地位还要高于理性主义。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "西方政治哲学的核心，其实是理想主义，其地位也要高于理性主义。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这两者之所以还能有交集，没把彼此看成疯子，全靠这个屈居副座的理性主义的平衡和调和。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "可以说，中国的统治阶级实际上是一群修了双学位的历史学家。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "管理学、数学、经济学……这些都是第二专业。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "ta们的第一专业一直都是历史，而且不仅仅是中国古代史、近代史、现代史、革命史，还包括美国史、欧洲史。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "历史规律、历史趋势和历史评价，是决定中国宏观政策的三大根本要素。", "char_start": 214, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "ta们永远是从一切过去出发，面向长久的将来，来决定现在、明天要怎么办。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因此要解读宏观政策，最重要的关键就是“关于若干历史问题的决议”和“最高纲领/最低纲领”。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这两样东西，一个是对过去的共识，一个是对未来的共识，是一切当前政策的全局背景，绝不是“官样文章”“宣传话术”。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "它们就像一前一后的两个锚点，实际上限制、收束了中间过程的动态范围。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "要了解西方的政策倾向，关键在神学和宗教。", "char_start": 418, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "要了解中国的政策走向，关键在历史观。", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 457}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0240"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：该遵从什么样的思路去解读政策？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“关键”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“中国政治哲学的核心，其实是经验主义。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "中国政治哲学的核心，其实是经验主义。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "bb73ac70-26cf-581c-8848-f91f9c3d98dd", "source_ordinal": 2488, "reading_ordinal": 1565, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "小改装", "published_at": "2022-12-17T14:43:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/502068800/answer/2805164501"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这很简单啊，尊重并不是羡慕。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "只有羡慕才有“想要成为”的效应，尊重本来就不带有这个功能。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "真正值得注意的是，为什么你会认为“尊重一定自带羡慕”？", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "是谁、是什么事情在向你暗示“尊重一定自带羡慕”？", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我们先说明一下这个“小改装”带来的危害——", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "既然尊重与羡慕绑定在一起，那么反过来，你会因为不羡慕而自动不尊重。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "仔细想想，不是吗？", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 163}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "那么问题来了——假设你又是一个自我感觉良好——或者更严重，不能允许自己自我感觉不良好、哪怕自欺欺人也要保持自我感觉良好——的人，那么你一定会在一个“我永远不羡慕任何人”的状态。", "char_start": 164, "char_end": 252}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而因为这个“小改装”的存在，这逻辑必然的意味着你将永远不尊重任何人。", "char_start": 253, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "现在，再问一遍：", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 296}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "是谁，是什么事，在向你暗示“尊重一定自带羡慕”？", "char_start": 297, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你看明白为什么这些人、这些事为什么失败吗？", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 343}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你还要继续坚持这个小改装吗？", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 358}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0240"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么我心里感觉我尊重工人，但是当我舍友问我：“你愿意做工人吗？”时，我第一反应是，不愿意？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“小改装”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这很简单啊，尊重并不是羡慕。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这很简单啊，尊重并不是羡慕。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2921320f-a79e-5aa2-a01d-91a45f4480b4", "source_ordinal": 2487, "reading_ordinal": 1566, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "老孩侠", "published_at": "2022-12-17T19:49:16+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/569015965/answer/2805513542"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "体现了一种习惯于依赖暴力和欺凌获得利益的行为习惯。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "给人取外号——尤其是侮辱性的外号——是极为下流卑鄙的行为，基本上等于承认自己既无能、又懦弱，只能耍流氓、搅浑水、放无赖，指望着靠这类下流手段“取胜”。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "不要给人取这种侮辱性的外号。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你一定要指代某一类人群，一定会存在可用的中性描述，甚至都不难找。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这种行为在明白人看来有多刺眼？", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "跟半夜举个闪光大喇叭广播“我是无赖”几乎没有区别。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你干一次，明白人就把你的门关上了。", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "多关几次，你就出不去了。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 223}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0240"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：将担心老人孩子感染新冠的人称为“老孩侠”体现了某些人的什么心理？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“老孩侠”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“体现了一种习惯于依赖暴力和欺凌获得利益的行为习惯。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "体现了一种习惯于依赖暴力和欺凌获得利益的行为习惯。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
